1
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:11,540
Mordor will pay for this.
These orcs are not from Mordor.

2
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:15,500
My lord Aemar, over here!

3
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:50,060
It was ambushed by orcs.

4
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:55,950
If we don't defend our country,
Saruman will take it by force.

5
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,640
Orcs are roaming freely across our lands.

6
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:01,700
Orcs bearing the white hand of Saruman.

7
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:04,620
That is a lie.

8
00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:12,460
Saruman the White has ever
been our friend and ally.

9
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:15,500
How long is it since Saruman borned you?

10
00:01:16,220 --> 00:01:18,340
What was the promised price, screamer?

11
00:01:18,740 --> 00:01:21,500
When all the men are dead, you will
take your share of the treasure?

12
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:32,640
You see much, Hail Mare, son of Aeolmund?

13
00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:34,920
Too much.

14
00:01:36,820 --> 00:01:43,280
You are banished forthwith from the
kingdom of Rohan, all its domains,

15
00:01:43,420 --> 00:01:49,140
under pain of death.
You have no authority here.

16
00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:51,460
Your orders mean nothing.

17
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:55,700
This order does not come from me.

18
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:58,280
It comes from the king.

19
00:01:59,060 --> 00:02:01,620
He signed it this morning.
